    [3912] = "Go to the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, and use the Videre Elixir. Follow the rest of Donova's instructions to find Gaeriyan.",
    [3913] = "Resurrect, then look for the gravestone that Gaeriyan told you to find.",
    [3914] = "Deliver Linken's Superior Sword to Linken in Un'Goro Crater.",
    [3941] = "Find J.D. Collie in the cave at Marshal's Refuge.",
    [3942] = "Find Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood.",
    [3961] = "Take the Silver Totem of Aquementas to Linken in Marshal's Refuge.",
    [3962] = "Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.$B$BFind Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",
    [3981] = "Find Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths.$B$BYou recall that the crudely drawn picture of the orc included bars drawn over the portrait. Perhaps you should search for a prison of some sort.",
    [3982] = "Defend Gor'shak.",
    [4001] = "Speak with Kharan Mighthammer and gather information about Princess Moira Bronzebeard's kidnapping. Take that information to Thrall in Orgrimmar.$B$BYou recall Gor'shak mentioning that Kharan is being held in a cell nearby.\n",
    [4002] = "Speak with Thrall if you are prepared to take on the mission he has planned.",
    [4003] = "Slay Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and free Princess Moira Bronzebeard from his evil spell. \n",
    [4004] = "Return to Thrall!\n",
    [4005] = "Take the Book of Aquor, the Silvery Claws, and the Irontree Heart to Tanaris.$B$BUse the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas.$B$BAfter you have the completed totem, take it to J.D. Collie in Marshal's Refuge.",
    [4024] = "Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay Bael'Gar.$B$BYou only know that the giant resides inside Blackrock Depths. Remember to use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on Bael'Gar's remains to capture the Fiery Essence.$B$BReturn the Encased Fiery Essence to Cyrus Therepentous.",
    [4063] = "Find and slay Golem Lord Argelmach. Return his head to Lotwil. You will also need to collect 10 Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs protecting Argelmach. You know this because you are psychic.",
    [4081] = "Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!$B$BWarlord Goretooth wants you to kill 15 Anvilrage Guardsmen, 10 Anvilrage Wardens and 5 Anvilrage Footmen. Return to him once your task is complete.",
    [4082] = "Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!$B$BWarlord Goretooth wants you to kill 10 Anvilrage Medics, 10 Anvilrage Soldiers and 10 Anvilrage Officers. Return to him once your task is complete.",
    [4083] = "The spectral chalice floats in the air, slowing rising and falling... as if to the beat of a dying heart.",
    [4084] = "Collect 11 Silvery Claws and 1 Irontree Heart for Eridan Bluewind in Felwood.",
    [4121] = "Escort your prisoner, Grark Lorkrub, through Burning Steppes and through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge.$B$BYou recall Lexlort mentioning that he would have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.$B$BYou will also be required to hand over your Thorium Shackles to Lexlort.",
    [4122] = "Travel to the Burning Steppes and find Grark Lorkrub. You recall Lexlort mentioning that he was last seen in a massive Blackrock fortress.$B$BWhen you find Grark Lorkrub, use the Thorium Shackles to bind him and then lead him back through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge. Lexlort will have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.",
    [4123] = "Bring the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4124] = "Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold.",
    [4125] = "Locate the courier's boat somewhere along the coast of Feralas.",
    [4126] = "Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",
    [4127] = "Return to Feathermoon Stronghold and show Ginro Hearthkindle the Discarded Knife you have found.",
    [4128] = "Speak with Ragnar Thunderbrew.",
    [4129] = "Take the Discarded Knife to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",
    [4130] = "Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold.",
    [4131] = "Search the Woodpaw Gnoll camps of southern Feralas for evidence of the courier's belongings or the courier himself.",
    [4132] = "Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay General Angerforge! Return to Warlord Goretooth when the task is complete.",
    [4133] = "Speak with Shadowmaster Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",
    [4134] = "Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",
    [4135] = "Now that Raschal's last known whereabouts have been discovered, continue your search for him or his remains in the Writhing Deep.  According to the note, it is located to the south of the Woodpaw gnoll camps.",
    [4136] = "Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4182] = "Slay 15 Black Broodlings, 10 Black Dragonspawn, 4 Black Wyrmkin and 1 Black Drake. Return to Helendis Riverhorn when the task is complete.",
    [4183] = "Travel to Lakeshire and deliver Helendis Riverhorn's Letter to Magistrate Solomon. ",
    [4184] = "Travel to Stormwind and deliver Solomon's Plea to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.$B$BBolvar resides in Stormwind Keep. ",
    [4185] = "Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon after speaking with Lady Katrana Prestor.",
    [4186] = "Take Bolvar's Decree to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire.\n",
    [4201] = "Bring 4 Gromsblood, 10 Giant Silver Veins and Nagmara's Filled Vial to Mistress Nagmara in Blackrock Depths.",
    [4223] = "Speak with Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4224] = "Speak with Ragged John to learn of Marshal Windsor's fate and return to Marshal Maxwell when you have completed this task.$B$BYou recall Marshal Maxwell telling you to search for him in a cave to the north.",
    [4241] = "Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor.$B$BYou recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison.",
    [4242] = "Give Marshal Maxwell the bad news.",
    [4263] = "Find Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths and destroy him!",
    [4264] = "You may have just stumbled on to something that Marshal Windsor would be interested in seeing. There may be hope, after all.",
    [4265] = "Free Raschal from the Zukk'ash hive.$B$BReturn to Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold and let him know that Raschal is alive and well.",
    [4266] = "Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",
    [4267] = "Bring Raschal's Report to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus.",
    [4281] = "Bring the Undelivered Parcel to Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar.",
    [4282] = "Return Marshal Windsor's Lost Information.$B$BMarshal Windsor believes that the information is being held by Golem Lord Argelmach and General Angerforge.",
    [4286] = "Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs. Return to Oralius when you have completed this task. You assume that the Dark Iron dwarves inside Blackrock Depths carry these 'fanny pack' contraptions.",
    [4322] = "Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed.",
    [4324] = "Speak with Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4341] = "Travel to Blackrock Depths and find Kharan Mighthammer.$B$BThe King mentioned that Kharan was being held prisoner there - perhaps you should try looking for a prison.",
    [4342] = "Listen as Kharan Mighthammer tells his story.",
    [4361] = "Return to Ironforge and deliver the bad news to King Magni Bronzebeard.",
    [4362] = "Return to Blackrock Depths and rescue Princess Moira Bronzebeard from the evil clutches of Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.\n",
    [4363] = "Return to Ironforge and speak with King Magni Bronzebeard.",
    [4487] = "Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",
    [4488] = "Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",
    [4489] = "Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",
    [4490] = "Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet to learn the ability to summon a Felsteed.",
    [4701] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",
    [4724] = "Slay Halycon, pack mistress of the Bloodaxe worg.",
    [4729] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Bloodaxe Worg Pups. Use the cage to carry the ferocious little beasts. Bring back a Caged Worg Pup to Kibler.",
    [4734] = "Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery.",
    [4735] = "Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4742] = "Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.$B$BThe Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak  of the Bloodaxe.",
    [4743] = "Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.$B$BIt is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!",
    [4764] = "Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4765] = "Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.",
    [4766] = "Speak with Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.",
    [4768] = "Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",
    [4769] = "Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.",
    [4771] = "Place Dawn's Gambit in the Viewing Room of the Scholomance.  Defeat Vectus, then return to Betina Bigglezink.",
    [4787] = "Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",
    [4788] = "Bring the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.",
    [4862] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.$B$BBy the sound of it, these eggs could be found near spiders.",
    [4866] = "In the heart of Blackrock Spire you will find Mother Smolderweb. Engage her and get her to poison you. Chances are good that you will have to kill her as well. Return to Ragged John when you are poisoned so that he can 'milk' you.",
    [4867] = "Read Warosh's Scroll.  Bring Warosh's Mojo to Warosh.",
    [4903] = "Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.",
    [4907] = "Speak with Tinkee Steamboil.",
    [4921] = "Find Mankrik's wife and then return to him in the Crossroads.",
    [4941] = "Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall.$B$BYou recall having seen Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber.",
    [4974] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar.",
    [4981] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.",
    [4982] = "Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city.",
    [4983] = "Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.",
    [5001] = "Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck!",
    [5002] = "Travel to the Burning Steppes and give Bijou's Information to Marshal Maxwell.",
    [5047] = "Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.",
    [5061] = "Return to Darnassus and show Mathrengyl Bearwalker the Pendant of the Sea Lion.",
    [5065] = "Bring the Third and Fourth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.",
    [5081] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy War Master Voone, Highlord Omokk, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.",
    [5089] = "Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.",
    [5096] = "Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent.$B$BPlace the Scourge banner at the camp, and then return to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5097] = "Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.$B$BOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5098] = "Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.$B$BOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5102] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.",
    [5122] = "The power of this chapel gives me the strength to resist the corruption in my heart.  If I leave it, I will become a death knight.   But there is a medallion, the medallion of faith, that will give me the strength I need to leave.$B$BPlease, $N, retrieve the medallion.  It is guarded by Malor the Zealous, a crazed member of the Scarlet Brotherhood who resides deep in the Scarlet Bastion in western Stratholme.",
    [5125] = "$N, I am dying... but my soul is saved.  For that, I owe you more than words can say.  Please, take this... and fight on, brave $C!",
    [5127] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.$B$BYou must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.$B$BReturn both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.",
    [5142] = "Find Pamela Redpath.",
    [5149] = "Find Pamela's doll.",
    [5152] = "Speak with Marlene, south of the Ruins of Andorhal.",
    [5153] = "Bring Joseph's Wedding Ring to Chromie.",
    [5154] = "Bring the Annals of Darrowshire to Chromie in Andorhal.",
    [5160] = "Travel to Winterspring and find Haleh. Give her Awbee's scale.",
    [5163] = "Take Umi's Mechanical Yeti and scare her friends with it:$B$BLegacki in Everlook (Winterspring)$BSprinkle in Gadgetzan (Tanaris)$BQuixxil in Marshal's Refuge (Un'Goro Crater)$B$BWhen you are done, bring the Mechanical Yeti back to Umi.",
    [5168] = "Bring Davil's Libram and Redpath's Shield to Carlin Redpath.",
    [5181] = "Bring the Skull of Horgus and the Shattered Sword of Marduk to Carlin Redpath at Light's Hope Chapel.",
    [5206] = "Bring 5 Resonating Skulls and the Mystic Crystal to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [5210] = "Bring the Extended Annals of Darrowshire to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [5211] = "Free 15 Darrowshire Spirits and return to Carlin Redpath.",
    [5212] = "Recover 20 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample.",
    [5213] = "Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink.",
    [5214] = "Find Ezra Grimm's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Grimm's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done.",
    [5241] = "Find Carlin Redpath.",
    [5243] = "Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid.",
    [5251] = "Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive.",
    [5262] = "Take the Head of Balnazzar to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [5263] = "Venture to Stratholme and destroy Baron Rivendare. Take his head and return to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff.\n",
    [5282] = "Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs!$B$BFree 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan.",
    [5341] = "Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",
    [5342] = "Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov.$B$BBe warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum.",
    [5343] = "Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",
    [5344] = "Travel to the Bulwark - Horde territory - and assassinate Alexi Barov. Take his head and return to Weldon Barov.$B$BBe warned, Alexi will probably be well protected by Horde filth.",
    [5382] = "Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete.\n",
    [5383] = "Take the Bag of Horrors to Eva Sarkhoff on Caer Darrow.",
    [5384] = "Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.$B$BFight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.\n",
    [5461] = "Travel to the Arathi Highlands, to the ruins of Stromgarde. Search Stromgarde for a Keepsake of Remembrance. If you find such an item, return with it to Magistrate Marduke.",
    [5462] = "Travel to Light's Hope in Eastern Plaguelands and seek out Leonid Barthalomew the Revered. Show him the Keepsake of Remembrance and tell him all that you have discovered.",
    [5463] = "Travel to Stratholme and find Menethil's Gift. Place the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the unholy ground. ",
    [5464] = "Take the Soulbound Keepsake to Leonid Barthalomew in Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [5465] = "Return to Magistrate Marduke in Caer Darrow. Show him the Soulbound Keepsake.",
    [5466] = "Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.",
    [5514] = "Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan.",
    [5515] = "Locate Jandice Barov in the Scholomance and destroy her. From her corpse recover Krastinov's Bag of Horrors. Return the bag to Eva Sarkhoff.",
    [5518] = "Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack.  He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.",
    [5525] = "It's called the Gordok Shackle Key - well, that's what these \"tons o' fun\" keep calling it.  I think any of the ogres might have it, but I'm not sure if any specific ones do.  Maybe the guards have a better chance of having one...$B$BWhat am I talking about - you have it already, don't you?!  Is that it there??!",
    [5528] = "You da big boss now, so you get free sample of my better brews!  These drinks boost you up AND give you good buzz!  These are da good ones, chief... you try and tell Kreeg yourself!",
    [5529] = "Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel.",
    [5531] = "Bring the Frozen Eggs to Betina Bigglezink.",
    [5533] = "Speak with Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5537] = "Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5538] = "Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan.",
    [5582] = "Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [5601] = "Find Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire.",
    [5721] = "Place the Relic Bundle at the Darrowshire town square.$B$BPrevent Davil Lightfire's death until the death of Horgus.$B$BPrevent Captain Redpath's death until Redpath the Corrupted appears.$B$BDefeat Redpath the Corrupted.$B$BSpeak with the spirit of Joseph Redpath when he appears at the town square, then speak with Pamela at her home.",
    [5742] = "Listen to what Tirion Fordring has to say.",
    [5762] = "Take Kravel's Crate to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn.",
    [5763] = "Bring Roon's Kodo Horn to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn.",
    [5781] = "Travel to the Undercroft - at the southernmost section of the Eastern Plaguelands - and recover Taelan's Hammer. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",
    [5801] = "Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater.  Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.$B$BBring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5802] = "Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater.  Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.$B$BBring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5803] = "Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5804] = "Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",
    [5845] = "Travel to Northdale, in the northeastern region of the Eastern Plaguelands, and recover the Symbol of Lost Honor. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",
    [5846] = "Travel to island of Caer Darrow, in the south-central region of the Plaguelands, and look for any clues as to the whereabouts of the painting.",
    [5848] = "Travel to Stratholme, in the northern part of the Plaguelands. It is in the Scarlet Bastion that you will find the painting 'Of Love and Family,' hidden behind another painting depicting the twin moons of our world.$B$BReturn the painting to Tirion Fordring.",
    [5861] = "Travel to Uther's Tomb, located in the southern Plaguelands. Show Myranda the Hag Tirion's Gift.",
    [5862] = "Speak to Myranda to gain the Scarlet Illusion. Travel to Hearthglen while under the Scarlet Illusion and deliver Tirion's Gift to Highlord Taelan Fordring.$B$BHearthglen is to the north, Taelan should be inside of Mardenholde Keep.",
    [5921] = "Use the spell \"Teleport: Moonglade\" to travel to Moonglade.  When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
    [5922] = "Use the spell \"Teleport: Moonglade\" to travel to Moonglade.  When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
    [5923] = "Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",
    [5924] = "Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",
    [5925] = "Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",
    [5926] = "Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",
    [5927] = "Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",
    [5928] = "Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",
    [5929] = "Seek out the Great Bear Spirit in northwestern Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear.  When finished, return to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, Moonglade.",
    [5930] = "Seek out the Great Bear Spirit in northwestern Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear.  When finished, return to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, Moonglade.",
    [5931] = "Return to Darnassus and speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave.",
    [5932] = "Return to Thunder Bluff and speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise.",
    [5941] = "Take the Bundle of Relics to Chromie in Andorhal.",
    [5942] = "Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",
    [5944] = "Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",
    [6001] = "Use the Cenarion Moondust on the Moonkin Stone of Auberdine to bring forth Lunaclaw.  From there, you must face Lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses.$B$BSpeak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus when you are done.",
    [6002] = "Use the Cenarion Lunardust on the Moonkin Stone between Mulgore and the Barrens to bring forth Lunaclaw.  From there, you must face Lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses.$B$BSpeak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff when you are done.",
    [6004] = "Kill 2 Scarlet Medics, 2 Scarlet Hunters, 2 Scarlet Magi and 2 Scarlet Knights before returning to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",
    [6023] = "Kill Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen before returning to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",
    [6025] = "Enter Hearthglen and find a high vantage point from which you can see the town and gauge the Scarlet Crusade's forces, then return to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",
    [6061] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame an Adult Plainstrider. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6062] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Dire Mottled Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar in Razor Hill.",
    [6063] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Webwood Lurker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6064] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Large Crag Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6065] = "Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6066] = "Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6067] = "Speak with Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6068] = "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.",
    [6069] = "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.",
    [6070] = "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.",
    [6071] = "Speak with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6072] = "Speak with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6073] = "Speak with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6074] = "Speak with Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6075] = "Speak with Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6076] = "Speak with Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6081] = "Speak with Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar.",
    [6082] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame an Armored Scorpid. Practice your skills, then return to Thotar at Razor Hill.",
    [6083] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Surf Crawler. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar at Razor Hill.",
    [6084] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Snow Leopard. Practice your skills, then return to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6085] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ice Claw Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos.",
    [6086] = "Speak with Belia Thundergranite in Ironforge.",
    [6087] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Prairie Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6088] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Swoop. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",
    [6089] = "Speak with Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.",
    [6101] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Nightsaber Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6102] = "Use the Taming Rod to tame a Strigid Screecher. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6103] = "Speak to Jocaste in the Cenarion Enclave, in Darnassus.",
    [6121] = "Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
    [6122] = "Use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler to draw a sample of water from the mouth of the cave by the falls.$B$BDeliver the Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine, Darkshore.",
    [6123] = "Bring 5 Earthroot and 12 Lunar Funguses to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine so she may make a curative salve.",
    [6124] = "Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them.  Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins.",
    [6125] = "Return to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",
    [6126] = "Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",
    [6127] = "Use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler to draw a sample of water from a pool at the top of the peak.$B$BDeliver the Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads, Barrens.",
    [6128] = "Bring 5 Earthroot and 5 Kodo Horns to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads so he may make a curative salve.",
    [6129] = "Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Gazelles that are located throughout the northern part of the Barrens; doing so should cure them.  Sickly Gazelles have been reported north of the east-west road that runs through the Crossroads.",
    [6130] = "Return to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff.",
    [6141] = "Speak with Brother Anton in Desolace.",
    [6144] = "Travel to the Undercity and speak with Varimathras.",
    [6145] = "Return to Eastern Plaguelands and track down the Crimson Courier. Kill the Courier and recover the Grand Crusader's Command.$B$BTake the command to Nathanos Blightcaller for further instruction.",
    [6146] = "Travel to Tyr's Hand, southeast of the Marris Stead. Once there, take a bite of the Rotten Apple. While under the guise of the Scarlet Crusade, deliver the Grand Crusader's Command to Crusader Lord Valdelmar.",
    [6147] = "Return to Nathanos Blightcaller with the new information.\n",
    [6148] = "The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed.",
    [6163] = "Travel to Stratholme and slay Ramstein the Gorger. Take his head as a souvenir for Nathanos.",
    [6402] = "Travel to Stormwind City and venture to the city gates. Speak with Squire Rowe so that he may let Marshal Windsor know that you have arrived.",
    [6403] = "Follow Reginald Windsor through Stormwind. Protect him from harm!\n\nSpeak to Squire Rowe if you need to contact Reginald Windsor again.",
    [6501] = "You must search the world for a being capable of restoring the power to the Fragment of the Dragon's Eye. The only information you possess about such a being is that they exist.",
    [6502] = "You must retrieve the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath.\n\nDrakkisath can be found in his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension in Blackrock Spire.",
    [6566] = "Listen to Thrall.",
    [6567] = "Seek out Rexxar. The Warchief has instructed you as to his whereabouts. Search the paths of Desolace, between the Stonetalon Mountains and Feralas.\n",
    [6568] = "Deliver Rexxar's Testament to Myranda the Hag in the Western Plaguelands.",
    [6569] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.",
    [6570] = "Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh and seek out Emberstrife's Den. Once inside, wear the Amulet of Draconic Subversion and speak with Emberstrife.\n",
    [6582] = "You must find the blue dragonflight drake champion, Scryer, and slay him. Pry his skull from his corpse and return it to Emberstrife.$B$BYou know that Scryer can be found in Winterspring.",
    [6583] = "Destroy the drake champion of the Green Flight, Somnus. Take his skull and return it to Emberstrife.",
    [6584] = "Guarding the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris Desert is Chronalis, child of Nozdormu. Destroy him and return his skull to Emberstrife.",
    [6585] = "Travel to Grim Batol and track down Axtroz, drake champion of the Red Flight. Destroy him and take his skull. Return the skull to Emberstrife.",
    [6601] = "It would appear as if the charade is over. You know that the Amulet of Draconic Subversion that Myranda the Hag created for you will not function inside Blackrock Spire. Perhaps you should find Rexxar and explain your predicament. Show him the Dull Drakefire Amulet. Hopefully he will know what to do next.",
    [6602] = "Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.",
    [6681] = "Take the Seal of Ravenholdt to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden away in the hills of Hillsbrad.$B$BYour cunning will be tested along the way. Be prepared.",
    [6721] = "Speak with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6722] = "Speak with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",
    [6981] = "Travel to Ratchet to find someone that can tell you more about the glowing shard.$B$BThen, deliver the shard as you are directed.",
    [7028] = "Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",
    [7029] = "Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.$B$BUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.$B$BHeal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village.",
    [7041] = "Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.$B$BUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.$B$BHeal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point.",
    [7044] = "Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond.$B$BFind a way to speak with Celebras.",
    [7046] = "Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras.$B$BSpeak with him when the ritual is complete.",
    [7064] = "Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",
    [7065] = "Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",
    [7066] = "Seek out Remulos in Moonglade and give him the Seed of Life.",
    [7067] = "Read the Pariah's Instructions. Afterwards, obtain the Amulet of Union from Maraudon and return it to the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace.",
    [7068] = "Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar.",
    [7070] = "Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Archmage Tervosh in Theramore on the coast of Dustwallow Marsh.",
    [7201] = "Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.",
    [7441] = "Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.$B$BReturn to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",
    [7461] = "You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated.$B$BEnter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum.$B$BReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",
    [7462] = "Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",
    [7463] = "Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.",
    [7481] = "Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.",
    [7482] = "Search Dire Maul for Telmius Dreamseeker. Report back to Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon with whatever information that you may find.",
    [7488] = "Bring Lethtendris' Web to Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",
    [7489] = "Bring Lethtendris's Web to Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",
    [7490] = "Take the Head of Onyxia to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
    [7491] = "Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",
    [7492] = "Speak with Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",
    [7493] = "A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.$B$BPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.$B$BCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian.",
    [7494] = "Speak with Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",
    [7495] = "Take the Head of Onyxia to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",
    [7496] = "Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes.",
    [7497] = "A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.$B$BPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.$B$BCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian.",
    [7498] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7499] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7500] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7501] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7502] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7503] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7504] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7505] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7506] = "Return the book to its rightful owners.",
    [7507] = "Return Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the Athenaeum.",
    [7508] = "Give the Dull and Flat Elven Blade to Lorekeeper Lydros.",
    [7509] = "You must get Onyxia to breathe fire on the Unfired Ancient Blade. Once this is done, pick up the now Heated Ancient Blade. Be warned, a Heated Ancient Blade will not remain heated forever - time is of the essence.$B$BThe last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.$B$BDo this and Quel'Serrar will be yours.",
    [7562] = "Speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7563] = "Bring 30 bottles of Raging Beast's Blood to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7564] = "Bring the Case of Blood to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7604] = "Turn the Thorium Brotherhood Contract in to Lokhtos Darkbargainer if you would like to receive the plans for Sulfuron.",
    [7623] = "Purchase Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.$B$BUse the potions to travel through Jaedenar, and speak with Lord Banehollow.",
    [7624] = "Confront Ulathek, then bring The Traitor's Heart to Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar.",
    [7625] = "Purchase Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan.  Bring it to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7626] = "Bring 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7627] = "Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7628] = "Bring 35 Black Dragonscales to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7629] = "Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance.  After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",
    [7630] = "Bring 3 Arcanite Bars to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",
    [7631] = "Read Mor'zul's Instructions.  Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed, defeat it, then bind its spirit to you.",
    [7632] = "Find the owner of the Ancient Petrified Leaf. Good luck, $n; It's a big world.",
    [7634] = "Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood.",
    [7635] = "Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",
    [7636] = "You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters:$B$BSimone the Seductress.$B$BKlinfran the Crazed.$B$BSolenor the Slayer.$B$BArtorius the Doombringer.$B$BDestroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads.$B$BRefer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts.$B$BYou MUST complete this task by yourself.",
    [7637] = "Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer.  You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.",
    [7638] = "Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District.",
    [7639] = "Return the Exorcism Censer to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",
    [7640] = "Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale.  When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",
    [7641] = "Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District.",
    [7642] = "Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.",
    [7643] = "Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse.  Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food.$B$BTravel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood.  Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit.  Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit.  Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it.",
    [7644] = "Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",
    [7645] = "Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits - the key ingredient in making Manna-Enriched Horse Feed - for Merideth Carlson at Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills.  The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits.$B$BYou also need to give her 50 gold to soothe her ruffled sensibilities.",
    [7646] = "Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",
    [7647] = "Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge.  Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver.  Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.$B$BGive the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",
    [7648] = "Take the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District for his inspection.",
    [7703] = "Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.$B$BAccording to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",
    [7761] = "That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.$B$BThe letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate.",
    [7785] = "Examine the Vessel of Rebirth and return it to Highlord Demitrian.",
    [7786] = "To free Thunderaan the Windseeker from his prison, you must present the right and left halves of the Bindings of the Windseeker, 10 bars of Elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord to Highlord Demitrian in Silithus.",
    [7787] = "Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",
    [7877] = "Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",
    [8181] = "Speak with Yeh'kinya.",
    [8182] = "Speak with Molthor in Stranglethorn.",
    [8323] = "Hermit Ortell wants you to bring him 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts",
    [8410] = "Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",
    [8412] = "Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",
    [8921] = "Return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan with 1 Delicate Arcanite Converter, 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil, 25 Volcanic Ash and 40 gold.",
    [8922] = "Bring the Sealed Blood Container to Mux Manascrambler inside Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",
    [8923] = "Take the Sealed Venom Container to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",
    [8924] = "Use the Ectoplasmic Distiller near incorporeal undead to collect 12 Scorched Ectoplasms in Silithus, 12 Frozen Ectoplasms in Winterspring and 12 Stable Ectoplasms in the Eastern Plaguelands.  Bring them along with the Ectoplasmic Distiller back to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",
    [8925] = "Find Magma Lord Bokk in the Burning Steppes, obtain his Magma Core and bring it to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",
    [8928] = "Search for an imp inside a cave at the entrance of Darkwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, purchase a Fel Elemental Rod and return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",
    [8929] = "Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon.",
    [8930] = "Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon.",
    [8945] = "Go into Stratholme and rescue Ysida Harmon from Baron Rivendare.",
    [8946] = "Bring Ysida's Locket to Anthion Harmon in Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [8947] = "Bring 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth and 4 Cured Rugged Hides to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands.",
    [8948] = "Take the incomplete Banner of Provocation to Falrin Treeshaper at the library in Dire Maul.",
    [8949] = "Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",
    [8950] = "Bring the following to Falrin Treeshaper inside Dire Maul: 1 Jeering Spectre's Essence, 4 Dark Runes and 8 Large Brilliant Shards.",
    [8960] = "Travel to Blackrock Mountain and use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",
    [8961] = "Gather the Incendicite of Incendius, the Ember of Emberseer and the Ash of Asharell, along with a Hallowed Brazier, and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8962] = "Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8963] = "Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8964] = "Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8965] = "Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8966] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Mor Grayhoof and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8967] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Isalien and slay her. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8968] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Jarien and Sothos and slay them. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8969] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8970] = "Gather 20 Bloodkelp from the Strashaz naga and then return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8977] = "Bring the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer  to Deliana in Ironforge.",
    [8978] = "Return to Mokvar in Orgrimmar with the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer.",
    [8985] = "Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8986] = "Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8987] = "Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8988] = "Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8989] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Mor Grayhoof and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8990] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Isalien and slay her. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8991] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Jarien and Sothos and slay them. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8992] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8994] = "Gather 40 Blackrock Bracers and acquire a Flask of Supreme Power. Return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",
    [8995] = "Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon Lord Valthalak. Dispatch him, and use Lord Valthalak's Amulet on the corpse. Then, return Lord Valthalak's Amulet to the Spirit of Lord Valthalak.",
    [8996] = "Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain and give him the Brazier of Beckoning.",
    [8997] = "Speak with Deliana at The High Seat in Ironforge.",
    [9015] = "Travel to the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths and place the Banner of Provocation in its center as you are sentenced by High Justice Grimstone.  Slay Theldren and his gladiators and return to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands with the first piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet.",
    [9362] = "Retrieve the Prismatic Shell for Archmage Xylem.  The Archmage resides in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara.",
    [9364] = "Polymorph the Spitelash of Azshara and kill the clones that appear several seconds later.  When you have slain 50 Polymorph Clones, return to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.",
    [65593] = "Bring the hearts of Avelina Lilly and Isaac Pearson to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.",
    [65597] = "Using the Lovers' Hearts, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Lovers' Hearts to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",
    [65601] = "Speak with Magar in Orgrimmar.",
    [65602] = "Retrieve the Wooden Figurine and bring it to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",
    [65603] = "Using the Wooden Figurine, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Wooden Figurine to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb.",
    [65604] = "Using the Withered Scarf, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Withered Scarf to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",
    [65610] = "Investigate Fallen Sky Lake in Ashenvale and report your findings to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",
    [78088] = "Bring the Althalaxx Orb to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",
    [78089] = "Bring the Althalaxx Orb to Katherine the Pure in Stormwind.",
    [78090] = "Find the warlock sanctum within Stormwind and seek advice on the orb.",
    [78091] = "Collect 14 Summoner's Salt from Blackrock Summoners in Redridge Mountains, then return to Ursula Deline in Stormwind.",
    [78092] = "Gather 12 Motes of Mannoroth from demons in Ashenvale. Bring them along with the Orb of Althalaxx to the Spear of Mannoroth at Demon Fall Canyon.",
    [78093] = "Return the Orb Shards to Delgren.",
    [78261] = "Find The Horn of Xelthos inside of Shadowfang Keep. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village. You must complete the job alone.",
    [78307] = "Log",
    [78676] = "Find The Eye of Bhossca inside of the Scarlet Monastery. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village. You must complete the job alone.",
    [78699] = "Log",
    [79007] = "Charred remains of the note serve as your only guide.",
    [79008] = "Charred remains of the note serve as your only guide.",
    [79192] = "You tear the note from the plank and read the scrawled writing.",
    [79358] = "Collect 5 Twisted Fire Totems, 5 Twisted Earth Totems, 5 Twisted Air Totems, and 5 Twisted Water Totems for Veyric Thunderhame in Arathi Highlands.",
