    [97168] = "If you are interested in helping Eldrun Stormbreaker in Ironforge, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond.",
    [97169] = "Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.$B$BBring Darkreaver's Head to Eldrun Stormbreaker in the Forlorn Caverns, Ironforge.",
    [97173] = "Recover a Blackmaw Ritual Totem from Blackmaw Hold.",
    [97174] = "Speak with Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep in Tirisfal Glades.",
    [97175] = "Travel to Orgrimmar and get High Priest Zayus's Exorcism Censer. You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.",
    [97176] = "Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the tormented spirits in Terrordale. When you have destroyed 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep in Tirisfal Glades.",
    [97177] = "Return the Exorcism Censer to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep in Tirisfal Glades.",
    [97178] = "Speak with Ott at the village of Tarren Mill in the Hillsbrad Foothills.",
    [97179] = "Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Ott in Hillsbrad Foothills.",
    [97180] = "Take the Arcanite Barding to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep for inspection.",
    [97182] = "Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands may be able to provide such a feed.$B$BTravel to the Dire Maul in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed to soothe it.$B$BLastly, give it the Arcanite Barding and hope that it is willing to provide the needed blessing.",
    [97183] = "Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep in Tirisfal Glades.",
    [97184] = "Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep in Tirisfal Glades.",
    [97185] = "Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver.  Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.$B$BGive the Spirit of Retribution and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",
    [97186] = "Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits for Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits. You'll also need to provide Blightcaller with 50 gold for his time.",
    [97197] = "Recover a Fragment of the Firelands from Blackrock Depths for Alaana Stormwalker in Mulgore.",
    [97198] = "Recover a Blackmaw Ritual Totem from Blackmaw Hold.",
    [97243] = "Bring the Torch of Dormant Flame to Olariaan Swiftburn at the Shrine of Flames in the Gustberry Lowlands.",
    [97244] = "Slay Skypriest Faladiel in the Gustberry Lowlands and collect Faladiel's Heart.",
    [97245] = "Find the home of Kuramaa in the Shen'dar Highlands, and defeat the spirit in combat. Bring Kuramaa's Mask to Olariaan Swiftburn in the Gustberry Lowlands when you are victorious.",
    [97250] = "Slay Alliance soldiers encroaching into the Barrens at the border to Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo.",
    [97257] = "Wait for Olariaan to begin the ritual at the Brazier of Offering and follow his instructions. You must deliver the Eternal Flame to Valanaar before the timer runs out.",
    [97288] = "Deliver the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell within the Undercity.",
    [97289] = "Bring the Head of the Baron to the body of Othmar in the Undercity.",
    [97290] = "Report your findings to Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity.",
    [97291] = "Collect a Toxic Skullcap from Tawny Grisette in the Trade Quarter, Blisterweed near the Herbalism Trainer, and Essence of Agony from the poison vendor in the Rogues' Quarter for Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity.",
